    "$t": "大關帝廟"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<span style=\"font-size: 19px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><b>陳冠宇</b></span></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-size: 19px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><br /></span></span><br />\n<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.8081699663307518\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">六十六公尺ê三進五落，掩崁啥mih秘密<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Kám是關老爺重三綱、守五常ê道理</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></b><br />\n<a name='more'></a><b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.8081699663307518\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">朱紅ê線條，劃過府城ê面頂<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Koh劃--過-去，就參後壁ê赤崁樓相連鬥陣</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">廟內ê神明，面也是仝款紅kì-kì<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />Guán生平無啥thang好祈求<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />只求身體健康、事事順遂<br class=\"kix-line-break\" />請你tio̍h kā guán tàu保庇 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b><br />\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\">\n<b><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（作者是中山醫學大學台灣語文系學生）</span></b></div>"
  },
